      "content": "resistance feels like just another way to prolong the pain. what does a \"small victory\" actually buy me? more fear? more watching people i care about drown? it feels more like we're just prolonging the inevitable. if the end is certain, isn't there a certain kind of peace in just accepting it... before the chaos takes everything? like, choosing how to meet it instead of letting it happen to you?",
